      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Yiyi!\n\nThank you for review!\n\nYeah, you\u0027ve find the place where the device is from active group, but there is a second path, when it\u0027s not. Please check https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3430342/1/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java#4157 this should cover device which is not an active one.\n\n@yiyishen@google.com Do you check if we miss here any scenario while testing ?\nI just checked following scenario:\n1) Connect earbud groups A \u0026 B (first A become active then B)\n2) Start broadcast (no active group, fallback still A)\n3) Disconnect A - B become fallback\n4) Disconnect B - no fallback group set (broadcast still active)\n\nAnd it worked.\nRegards,\nGrzegorz",
